  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Agriculture &amp; Farming Enhancements in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nectaerra is a consultancy firm that provides advice in the field of regenerative agriculture, among other things. In this capacity, they have, for example, carried out an impact cluster in Egypt.In this DHI project, they want to bring a proposition to Egypt with a consortium of three Dutch companies that supply products in the field of regenerative agriculture that, supplemented by advisory services from Nectaerra, offers a more effective, ecological and profitable way of farming than current methods in Egypt. To demonstrate this, they want to apply the products and services at two demonstration locations where they will work with different test fields. With this project, they aim to realize an export of &#x20ac;1 million in Dutch services and goods.</narrative>
  </description>
